{"real": true, "dur": 83.23, "sent": [{"start": 0.2, "end": 6.94, "text": "A word about how I built this, since the title talks about an AI platform with no development team.", "words": [{"w": "A", "s": 0.2}, {"w": "word", "s": 0.36}, {"w": "about", "s": 0.8}, {"w": "how", "s": 1.12}, {"w": "I", "s": 1.4}, {"w": "built", "s": 1.52}, {"w": "this,", "s": 1.84}, {"w": "since", "s": 2.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 3.18}, {"w": "title", "s": 3.34}, {"w": "talks", "s": 3.74}, {"w": "about", "s": 4.019}, {"w": "an", "s": 4.26}, {"w": "AI", "s": 4.5}, {"w": "platform", "s": 4.86}, {"w": "with", "s": 5.5}, {"w": "no", "s": 5.8}, {"w": "development", "s": 6.06}, {"w": "team.", "s": 6.66}]}, {"start": 7.9, "end": 10.76, "text": "I built FluOLinGo with AI coding tools.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 7.9}, {"w": "built", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 8.42}, {"w": "with", "s": 9.26}, {"w": "AI", "s": 9.58}, {"w": "coding", "s": 9.92}, {"w": "tools.", "s": 10.34}]}, {"start": 11.24, "end": 16.48, "text": "They’re fast, and they made it possible for someone like me, who can’t code.", "words": [{"w": "They’re", "s": 11.24}, {"w": "fast,", "s": 11.52}, {"w": "and", "s": 12.66}, {"w": "they", "s": 12.8}, {"w": "made", "s": 12.96}, {"w": "it", "s": 13.14}, {"w": "possible", "s": 13.32}, {"w": "for", "s": 13.8}, {"w": "someone", "s": 14.02}, {"w": "like", "s": 14.34}, {"w": "me,", "s": 14.58}, {"w": "who", "s": 15.52}, {"w": "can’t", "s": 15.74}, {"w": "code.", "s": 16.1}]}, {"start": 17.34, "end": 18.9, "text": "But they can get the teaching wrong.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 17.34}, {"w": "they", "s": 17.5}, {"w": "can", "s": 17.68}, {"w": "get", "s": 17.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.08}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 18.22}, {"w": "wrong.", "s": 18.62}]}, {"start": 19.7, "end": 20.82, "text": "Here’s a real example.", "words": [{"w": "Here’s", "s": 19.7}, {"w": "a", "s": 19.98}, {"w": "real", "s": 20.08}, {"w": "example.", "s": 20.3}]}, {"start": 21.72, "end": 25.98, "text": "Remember the lesson page, with one exercise and three levels?", "words": [{"w": "Remember", "s": 21.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 22.3}, {"w": "page,", "s": 22.64}, {"w": "with", "s": 23.66}, {"w": "one", "s": 23.9}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 24.12}, {"w": "and", "s": 25.06}, {"w": "three", "s": 25.28}, {"w": "levels?", "s": 25.54}]}, {"start": 26.52, "end": 30.6, "text": "Earlier AI helpers broke that up into lots of separate activities.", "words": [{"w": "Earlier", "s": 26.52}, {"w": "AI", "s": 27.24}, {"w": "helpers", "s": 27.54}, {"w": "broke", "s": 28.12}, {"w": "that", "s": 28.36}, {"w": "up", "s": 28.56}, {"w": "into", "s": 28.72}, {"w": "lots", "s": 29.0}, {"w": "of", "s": 29.26}, {"w": "separate", "s": 29.44}, {"w": "activities.", "s": 29.86}]}, {"start": 31.44, "end": 37.66, "text": "Each looked fine by itself, but the teaching idea behind it was gone, and only a teacher would notice.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 31.44}, {"w": "looked", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "fine", "s": 32.0}, {"w": "by", "s": 32.259}, {"w": "itself,", "s": 32.42}, {"w": "but", "s": 33.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 33.46}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 33.6}, {"w": "idea", "s": 34.02}, {"w": "behind", "s": 34.4}, {"w": "it", "s": 34.76}, {"w": "was", "s": 34.92}, {"w": "gone,", "s": 35.18}, {"w": "and", "s": 35.92}, {"w": "only", "s": 36.14}, {"w": "a", "s": 36.44}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 36.56}, {"w": "would", "s": 36.96}, {"w": "notice.", "s": 37.16}]}, {"start": 38.2, "end": 41.86, "text": "Since then, I’ve found two things that help prevent that.", "words": [{"w": "Since", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "then,", "s": 38.5}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 39.36}, {"w": "found", "s": 39.56}, {"w": "two", "s": 39.88}, {"w": "things", "s": 40.14}, {"w": "that", "s": 40.9}, {"w": "help", "s": 41.02}, {"w": "prevent", "s": 41.22}, {"w": "that.", "s": 41.68}]}, {"start": 42.68, "end": 49.9, "text": "First, I write down my teaching decisions in plain language and make sure the AI always has access to them.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 42.68}, {"w": "I", "s": 43.66}, {"w": "write", "s": 43.74}, {"w": "down", "s": 44.02}, {"w": "my", "s": 44.2}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 44.4}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 44.74}, {"w": "in", "s": 45.42}, {"w": "plain", "s": 45.6}, {"w": "language", "s": 45.88}, {"w": "and", "s": 46.8}, {"w": "make", "s": 46.96}, {"w": "sure", "s": 47.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 47.38}, {"w": "AI", "s": 47.56}, {"w": "always", "s": 48.4}, {"w": "has", "s": 48.78}, {"w": "access", "s": 49.08}, {"w": "to", "s": 49.52}, {"w": "them.", "s": 49.68}]}, {"start": 50.34, "end": 56.72, "text": "Second, I look at the actual screen myself, because the AI’s description of it can be wrong.", "words": [{"w": "Second,", "s": 50.34}, {"w": "I", "s": 51.26}, {"w": "look", "s": 51.38}, {"w": "at", "s": 51.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.78}, {"w": "actual", "s": 51.98}, {"w": "screen", "s": 52.32}, {"w": "myself,", "s": 52.6}, {"w": "because", "s": 53.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 54.2}, {"w": "AI’s", "s": 54.42}, {"w": "description", "s": 54.84}, {"w": "of", "s": 55.56}, {"w": "it", "s": 55.76}, {"w": "can", "s": 56.0}, {"w": "be", "s": 56.24}, {"w": "wrong.", "s": 56.4}]}, {"start": 57.66, "end": 64.379, "text": "As a result, those written rules help stop the AI from making teaching decisions on its own.", "words": [{"w": "As", "s": 57.66}, {"w": "a", "s": 57.88}, {"w": "result,", "s": 57.96}, {"w": "those", "s": 59.1}, {"w": "written", "s": 59.46}, {"w": "rules", "s": 59.88}, {"w": "help", "s": 60.56}, {"w": "stop", "s": 60.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.2}, {"w": "AI", "s": 61.38}, {"w": "from", "s": 61.84}, {"w": "making", "s": 62.1}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 62.5}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 62.88}, {"w": "on", "s": 63.62}, {"w": "its", "s": 63.84}, {"w": "own.", "s": 64.099}]}, {"start": 64.76, "end": 70.7, "text": "And because every rule comes from a specific source, I can check whether the AI has followed it.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 64.76}, {"w": "because", "s": 64.94}, {"w": "every", "s": 65.58}, {"w": "rule", "s": 65.9}, {"w": "comes", "s": 66.24}, {"w": "from", "s": 66.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 66.72}, {"w": "specific", "s": 66.86}, {"w": "source,", "s": 67.48}, {"w": "I", "s": 68.6}, {"w": "can", "s": 68.68}, {"w": "check", "s": 68.92}, {"w": "whether", "s": 69.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 69.48}, {"w": "AI", "s": 69.7}, {"w": "has", "s": 69.98}, {"w": "followed", "s": 70.24}, {"w": "it.", "s": 70.58}]}, {"start": 71.22, "end": 74.02, "text": "In the same way, you can check my decisions.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 71.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 71.32}, {"w": "same", "s": 71.48}, {"w": "way,", "s": 71.78}, {"w": "you", "s": 72.56}, {"w": "can", "s": 72.68}, {"w": "check", "s": 72.9}, {"w": "my", "s": 73.14}, {"w": "decisions.", "s": 73.34}]}, {"start": 74.56, "end": 82.46, "text": "In short, it is absolutely necessary that the teacher remains actively in the loop throughout this process.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 74.56}, {"w": "short,", "s": 74.74}, {"w": "it", "s": 75.58}, {"w": "is", "s": 75.7}, {"w": "absolutely", "s": 76.0}, {"w": "necessary", "s": 76.72}, {"w": "that", "s": 77.94}, {"w": "the", "s": 78.14}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 78.34}, {"w": "remains", "s": 78.82}, {"w": "actively", "s": 79.5}, {"w": "in", "s": 80.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 80.32}, {"w": "loop", "s": 80.52}, {"w": "throughout", "s": 81.06}, {"w": "this", "s": 81.66}, {"w": "process.", "s": 81.9}]}]}